			"",
			"/*",
			" * Sparse_Table — Static RMQ / Range Query in O(1) or O(log n)",
			" *",
			" * Template params:",
			" *   T        = answer/value type              (default int)",
			" *   Op       = binary combine functor         (default MinOp<T> = min)",
